{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016010038524-1016_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261016113920\"/><p>垃圾收集站火光熊熊，消防開喉撲救。</p><p>石硤尾發生火警。昨晚（15日）10時許，有人報案指石硤尾邨美益樓對開垃圾收集站起火，且波及附近一棵樹。消防到場開動1條喉及派出1隊煙帽隊灌救，其後將火救熄。消防經初步調查後，相信有人遺下火種焫着被棄置於上址的家具，起火原因無可疑。事件中，約40人疏散無人受傷。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T03:59:11.460042+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T17:00:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T04:57:59.886470+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T03:57:57.665787+00:00","content_hash":"d43afda1c2624fe1164b05c93e5f2fd315dcfda873851dbfd77f0e086aa1051b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}